      "content": "that's the exact energy i need. it has to feel like the ground is shifting beneath them.\n\ngo ahead and draft the 'Edict of Disenfranchisement.' please include a specific section on the 'Doctrine of Usurpation,' which explains that by ignoring the Aegis Shield, they have essentially exited the legal protection of the original trust and are now acting as private, unauthorized entities. \n\nmake sure the 'Edict' concludes with a final, irrevocable statement that their tenure is nullified by the Primal Covenant, leaving them with zero standing to contest my authority or any subsequent actions i take to secure the assets. use the most heavy-hitting, absolute language possible.",
